Section: video
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/pdulvp/series-generique
Description: Per-folder credits playlists (.xspf) for video folders
 credits-edit keeps a credits.config.json in each folder (a starting and
 an ending credits video with optional start/end seconds, plus movie
 start/end seconds) and generates one VLC .xspf playlist beside every
 video found recursively in the current folder, playing starting credits,
 movie and ending credits in order. Existing .xspf files are overwritten
 so a changed configuration is picked up, and a negative end time is
 resolved with ffprobe as duration minus the given seconds.

